sequenceDiagram
    actor Watcher
    participant Client
    participant MiniEngine
    participant BrowserCache
    participant Server
    participant Cache
    participant Engine
    participant NodeWorker
    actor Developer

    Developer ->> Client: Feeds pipeline file

    Watcher -->>+ Client: Interacts with asset (playhead / seek time t)

    Client ->> Client: Resolve chunk grid<br/>(keyframe-aligned, ~10s)<br/>chunk_ids = [current, +prefetch window]

    Client -->>+ MiniEngine: Check local execution availability(sys_specs, pipeline_file)
    MiniEngine -->>- Client: Node-level capability map (client-capable vs cloud-only)

    loop for each needed chunk_id
        Client -->>+ BrowserCache: Check chunk cache(asset_id, execution_key, chunk_id)
        BrowserCache -->>- Client: hit / miss

        alt Chunk missing on client
            Client -->>+ Server: Request chunk<br/>execution_key = hash(asset_id + params + chunk_id)

            Server -->>+ Cache: Check chunk cache(execution_key)

            alt Chunk not cached server-side
                Server -->>+ Engine: Run pipeline for chunk_id

                Engine ->> Engine: Classify nodes:<br/>stateless-per-chunk vs sequential-state-required

                opt Node requires state from previous chunk
                    Engine -->>+ Cache: Fetch trailing_state(chunk_id - 1)
                    Cache -->>- Engine: trailing_state (or null if chunk 0 / cold start)
                    Note over Engine: Process with overlap window,<br/>trim to chunk boundary,<br/>so parallel chunks stay possible<br/>on first-ever run
                end

                par Stateless nodes (parallel-safe)
                    Engine ->>+ NodeWorker: Launch worker (node executable, chunk data)
                    NodeWorker -->>- Engine: result (type, data)
                and Sequential nodes (ordered)
                    Engine ->>+ NodeWorker: Launch worker (node executable, chunk data, trailing_state)
                    NodeWorker -->>- Engine: result (type, data) + new trailing_state
                end

                Engine -->>+ Cache: Store chunk result + trailing_state (keyed by execution_key)
                Cache -->>- Engine: ack
                Engine -->>- Server: Return chunk result (base track + mask/aux track)
            else Chunk cached
                Cache -->>- Server: Return cached chunk (base + mask/aux track)
            end

            Server -->>- Client: Stream chunk manifest entry<br/>(base track + mask track, synced timestamps)
            Client -->>+ BrowserCache: Store chunk<br/>Evict chunks outside LRU window (relative to playhead)
            BrowserCache -->>- Client: ack
        end
    end

    Client -->>+ MiniEngine: Composite client-side nodes per frame<br/>(e.g. color blend using base + mask textures)
    MiniEngine -->>- Client: Rendered frame
    Client -->>- Watcher: Display frame